{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Area access: flights to locked Outland and Northrend flight points are refused",
  "contract": "Player::ActivateTaxiPathTo asks OnPlayerBeforeActivateTaxiPath before anything else. A route whose nodes include a locked location is refused and the player is told once (chat line throttled to one per 30 seconds); a route inside unlocked areas still starts. The routes are requested with the client's CMSG_ACTIVATETAXIEXPRESS for Stormwind (node 2) to Shattrath (node 128, Terokkar, map 530) and to Dalaran (node 310, map 571). A route with no path would also fail to fly, so the refusal is proven by the chat line, which only the lock sends. Control: Stormwind to Lakeshire (node 5) starts a flight. Requires the default Coa.Access.* values (all locked).",
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
